# only work on png file

I.labelme_json2yolo_txt.py : convert labelme json to yolo txt format(x1y1x2y2...xnyn)

  1.create img_save folder

  2.put images and labels into img_save

  3.execute python3 labelme_json2yolo_txt.py

-------------------------------------------
II.yolo_txt2labelme_json.py : convert yolo txt to labelme json format(x1y1x2y2...xnyn)

  1.create img_save folder

  2.put images and labels into img_save

  3.execute python3 yolo_txt2labelme_json.py

--------------------------------------------
III.labelimgII_xml2yolo_txt.py.py : convert labelimg2 xml to yolo obb txt format(x1y1x2y2x3y3x4y4)

  1.create img_save folder

  2.put images and labels into img_save

  3.execute python3 labelimgII_xml2yolo_txt.py

